# Reviewed Trivy misconfiguration suppressions. make scan passes this file to
# every Trivy run with --ignorefile. Give each entry a reason, and remove an
# entry as soon as its reason no longer holds.

# GIT-0001 (Repository is public): config/infra manages this template's own
# GitHub repository, which is public on purpose so others can use it as a
# template. A derived private repository should set repository_visibility to
# "private" (config/infra/variables.tf or terraform.tfvars) and delete this entry.
GIT-0001
